* CABSRT05 - SORT RATED DETAIL FOR BILL DETAIL BUILD
* USED WHEN CABRAT10 IS RERUN STANDALONE - RESEQUENCES THE
* RATED CHAIN BY BAN/SECTION/LINE BEFORE THE BUILD STEP.
*
* THE OUTREC BELOW REFORMATS THE RECORD AND, AS A SIDE EFFECT,
* ZEROES THE RT-RETRY-COUNT FIELD (COLUMNS 165-167) ON EVERY
* RECORD THAT PASSES THROUGH.  THIS WAS ADDED IN 2012 SO A
* RERUN WOULD NOT INHERIT A STALE RETRY COUNT FROM THE FAILED
* ATTEMPT - NO CABRAT PROGRAM RESETS THIS FIELD ITSELF.
 SORT FIELDS=(9,13,CH,A,150,3,CH,A,153,4,CH,A)
 OUTREC FIELDS=(1,164,ZD,LENGTH=3,165,3,164,33)
 OPTION EQUALS
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=200
